@startuml
title Вариант 2: основной сценарий, push доставлен
autonumber
participant "сервис банка" as S
participant "notification-api" as API
queue "Kafka" as K
participant "delivery-\norchestrator" as O
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "preferences" as P
participant "push-adapter" as PA
database "Redis" as R
participant "FCM / APNs" as FCM
participant "мобильное\nприложение" as APP
participant "callback-api" as CB

S -> API: POST /notifications, event_id
API -> K: transactional.requests, acks=all
API --> S: 202
K -> O: запрос
O -> P: цепочка каналов
P --> O: push, sms, email
O -> DB: одна транзакция:\nINSERT доставки ON CONFLICT (event_id) DO NOTHING\nstate=WAIT_PUSH, deadline=+15 с\noutbox: запрос push
O -> K: push.requests из outbox
K -> PA: запрос
PA -> R: SETNX ключ отправки
PA -> FCM: отправить
PA -> K: channel.results: принято
FCM -> APP: push
APP -> CB: ack
CB -> K: delivery.events: push доставлен
K -> O: ack
O -> DB: UPDATE state=DELIVERED\nWHERE state=WAIT_PUSH
O -> K: delivery.status, читает ClickHouse
@enduml
